---
---

<div class='py-24 sm:py-32'>
  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8'>
    <div>
      <div class='mx-auto max-w-2xl sm:text-center'>
        <h2 class='text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-slate-50 sm:text-4xl'>Transparente Preise für IT-Dienstleistungen</h2>
      </div>
      <div
        class='mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl rounded-3xl ring-1 ring-gray-200 dark:ring-slate-700/70 sm:mt-20 lg:mx-0 lg:flex lg:max-w-none'>
        <div class='p-8 sm:p-10 lg:flex-auto'>
          <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-slate-50'>Faire Preise für hochwertige IT-Leistungen</h3>
          <p class='mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300'>Ich biete Ihnen umfassende IT- und Design-Services zu einem attraktiven Stundensatz. Qualität und Kundenzufriedenheit stehen dabei immer an erster Stelle.</p>
          <div class='mt-10 flex items-center gap-x-4'>
            <h4 class='flex-none text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600'>Leistungsübersicht:</h4>
            <div class='h-px flex-auto bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-500'></div>
          </div>
          <ul role='list'
              class='mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6'>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              Webdesign & Printmedien
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              IT-Administration & Support
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              Open-Source-Software-Lösungen
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              Webentwicklung (Websites, Anwendungen)
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              DevSecOps & Prozessoptimierung
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              IT-Beratung
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              Individuelle Smart Home Konzepte
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              SEWOBE-Support (Erstberatung & Einrichtung)¹
            </li>
            <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
              <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none animate-bounce text-primary-600 dark:text-emerald-600' viewBox='0 0 20 20'
                   fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
                <path fill-rule='evenodd'
                      d='M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z'
                      clip-rule='evenodd' />
              </svg>
              Scrum Master & Product Owner Services
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class='-mt-2 p-2 lg:mt-0 lg:w-full lg:h-full lg:max-w-md lg:shrink-0 self-center'>
          <div
            class='rounded-2xl bg-primary-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 py-10 text-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-900/5 dark:ring-slate-700:60 lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:justify-center lg:py-32'>
            <div class='mx-auto max-w-xs px-8'>
              <p class='text-base font-semibold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300'>Abrechnung je angefangene 15 Minuten</p>
              <p class='mt-6 flex items-baseline justify-center gap-x-2'>
                <span class='text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50'>17,50€</span>
                <span class='text-sm font-semibold leading-6 tracking-wide text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300'>EUR</span>
              </p>
              <a href='mailto:kontakt@waldheim.dev'
                 class='flex gap-1 items-center justify-center mt-10 block w-full rounded-md bg-primary-600 dark:bg-emerald-800 px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-xs hover:bg-primary-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-wd'>Jetzt Kontakt aufnehmen
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="animate-pulse w-6 h-6">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
                </svg>
              </a>
              <p class='mt-6 text-xs leading-5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300'>Gemäß §19
                UStG enthält der Rechnungsbetrag keine
                Umsatzsteuer.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm'><small>1) Nur für Neukunden, die über waldheim.dev einen Vertrag mit SEWOBE abschließen. Komplexere Anfragen werden an die SEWOBE AG weitergeleitet.</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>